lute bottom-0 left-0 text-white/90 text-sm md:text-[15px] font-light leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-left" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);width:100%">Designed to rise above its surroundings, the residences enjoy expansive views of greenery and the city beyond, creating a sense of openness and quiet retreat.</p><p class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 text-white/90 text-sm md:text-[15px] font-light leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-left" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);width:100%">Every home is planned with clarity and balance, combining functional layouts, natural light, and refined detailing to support modern lifestyles.</p><p class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 text-white/90 text-sm md:text-[15px] font-light leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-left" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);width:100%">Strategically located to offer city accessibility while remaining removed from noise and congestion, allowing residents to enjoy calm living without compromise.</p></div></div></div><div class="md:hidden relative w-full" style="background-color:#D5B27C"><section class="relative z-20 px-3 pt-20" style="background-color:#D5B27C"><div class="relative w-full h-[65vh]"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="opacity:0"><img alt="Elevated Living" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/images/kedarImage/liv1.webp"/></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-40 pointer-events-none z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to top, #D5B27CE6, #D5B27C66, transparent)"></div><div class="absolute bottom-6 left-0 w-full px-4 z-20"><div class="flex justify-between w-full items-end gap-2"><button class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 group py-4 -my-4"><div class="w-full h-[2px] bg-[#FFFAF6]/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-white transition-all duration-500 w-full"></div></div></button><button class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 group py-4 -my-4"><div class="w-full h-[2px] bg-[#FFFAF6]/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-white transition-all duration-500 w-0"></div></div></button><button class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 group py-4 -my-4"><div class="w-full h-[2px] bg-[#FFFAF6]/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-white transition-all duration-500 w-0"></div></div></button><button class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 group py-4 -my-4"><div class="w-full h-[2px] bg-[#FFFAF6]/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-white transition-all duration-500 w-0"></div></div></button></div></div></div><div class="px-3 pt-8 pb-16 max-w-md" style="background-color:#D5B27C"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)"><h3 class="font-theSeasons text-3xl mb-4 text-[#E0E0E0]">Elevated Living</h3><div class="text-[#FFFAF6] text-sm leading-tight">More than just homes, Kedar offers a refined living experience shaped by comfort, privacy, and thoughtful design that supports everyday ease and long term well being.</div></div></div></section></div><section id="about" class="md:pt-24 md:pb-18 py-14 bg-white font-sans"><div class="mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20 xl:px-54 flex flex-col md:block"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-6 mb-6 md:mb-18 order-1 md:order-none"><h2 class="text-4xl text-[#1E1E1E] md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl  font-light leading-tight" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Redefining the Essence of Living</h2><div class="hidden md:flex w-full md:w-fit" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><a class="group flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2 px-6 py-5 lg:px-4 lg:py-5 text-white transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-[16px] md:text-sm font-bold w-full" style="background-color:#5A1F26" href="/project-enquire?project=kedar"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right w-5 h-5 group-hover:rotate-45 transition-all duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg>Enquire Now</a></div></div><div class="max-w-full mb-8 md:mb-12 order-3 md:order-none" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><p class="text-lg text-[#505153] font-light ">Introducing Kedar, a contemporary residential address shaped by Mukund MGM Realty’s long-standing approach to quality and value. Thoughtfully planned duplex residences offer generous layouts, refined interiors, and a sense of openness that supports both everyday comfort and special moments. With carefully selected amenities and a location at the heart of Mangalore, Kedar brings homes that feel considered and easy to live in for years to come.</p></div><div class="order-2 md:order-none mb-8 md:mb-0"><div class="relative w-full aspect-video md:aspect-21/9 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 group"><div class="swiper w-full h-full"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide w-full h-full"><div class="relative w-full h-full bg-gray-100"><img alt="Thumbnail" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover cursor-pointer" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FkedarImage%2FvideoPlaceholder.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/